#: pyvista_js.Camera.clipping_range:1 ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Get or set the clipping range (near, far)."
msgstr "クリッピング範囲 (near, far) を取得または設定します。"

#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid ":py:obj:`elevation <pyvista_js.Camera.elevation>`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`elevation <pyvista_js.Camera.elevation>`"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.elevation:1
#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Get or set the camera elevation angle in degrees."
msgstr "カメラの仰角を度数で取得または設定します。"

#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid ":py:obj:`focal_point <pyvista_js.Camera.focal_point>`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`focal_point <pyvista_js.Camera.focal_point>`"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.focal_point:1
#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Get or set the camera focal point."
msgstr "カメラの注視点を取得または設定します。"

#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid ":py:obj:`parallel_projection <pyvista_js.Camera.parallel_projection>`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`parallel_projection <pyvista_js.Camera.parallel_projection>`"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.Camera.parallel_projection:1 ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Get or set parallel projection mode."
msgstr "平行投影モードを取得または設定します。"

#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid ":py:obj:`position <pyvista_js.Camera.position>`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`position <pyvista_js.Camera.position>`"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.position:1
#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Get or set the camera position."
msgstr "カメラの位置を取得または設定します。"

#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid ":py:obj:`view_angle <pyvista_js.Camera.view_angle>`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`view_angle <pyvista_js.Camera.view_angle>`"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.view_angle:1
#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Get or set the camera view angle in degrees."
msgstr "カメラの視野角を度数で取得または設定します。"

#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid ":py:obj:`view_up <pyvista_js.Camera.view_up>`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`view_up <pyvista_js.Camera.view_up>`"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.view_up:1
#: ../:1:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Get or set the view-up vector."
msgstr "ビューアップベクトルを取得または設定します。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.camera.Camera.azimuth:3
msgid ""
"Rotation angle in degrees.  Positive values rotate counter-clockwise when "
"viewed from above the up vector."
msgstr "回転角 (度)。上ベクトルの上から見て正の値は反時計回りに回転します。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.Camera.clipping_range:3
msgid "Near and far clipping plane distances as (near, far)."
msgstr "近接・遠方クリッピング平面の距離 (near, far)。"

#: ../api/_autosummary/pyvista_js.Camera.rst:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.Camera.clipping_range:6
msgid "Clipping range as (near, far)."
msgstr "クリッピング範囲 (near, far)。"

#: ../api/_autosummary/pyvista_js.Camera.rst:0
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.camera.Camera.disable_parallel_projection:3
msgid ""
"Switches the camera from parallel projection to perspective projection. This"
" is equivalent to setting ``parallel_projection = False``."
msgstr ""
"カメラを平行投影から透視投影に切り替えます。これは ``parallel_projection = False`` を設定することと同じです。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.elevation:3
msgid ""
"The elevation angle controls the vertical rotation of the camera. It rotates"
" the camera about the cross product of the negative of the direction of "
"projection and the view up vector, using the focal point as the center of "
"rotation."
msgstr ""
"仰角はカメラの垂直方向の回転を制御します。注視点を回転中心として、投影方向の逆ベクトルとビューアップベクトルの外積の周りでカメラを回転させます。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.elevation:8
#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.elevation:11
msgid "Elevation angle in degrees."
msgstr "仰角 (度)。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.camera.Camera.enable_parallel_projection:3
msgid ""
"Switches the camera from perspective projection to parallel projection. This"
" is equivalent to setting ``parallel_projection = True``."
msgstr ""
"カメラを透視投影から平行投影に切り替えます。これは ``parallel_projection = True`` を設定することと同じです。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.focal_point:3
#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.focal_point:6
msgid "Focal point as (x, y, z)."
msgstr "注視点 (x, y, z)。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.camera.Camera.orbit_elevation:3
msgid ""
"This method is named ``orbit_elevation`` to avoid conflict with the "
":attr:`elevation` property, which stores a static angle value."
msgstr ""
"このメソッドが ``orbit_elevation`` と名付けられているのは、静的な角度値を格納する :attr:`elevation` "
"プロパティとの衝突を避けるためです。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.camera.Camera.orbit_elevation:6
msgid "Rotation angle in degrees.  Positive values tilt the camera upward."
msgstr "回転角 (度)。正の値でカメラを上方向に傾けます。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.Camera.parallel_projection:3
msgid ""
"When True, uses parallel (orthographic) projection instead of perspective "
"projection. Parallel projection is useful for viewing 2D datasets, CAD-like "
"orthographic views, and scientific visualization where perspective "
"distortion is undesirable."
msgstr ""
"True の場合、透視投影の代わりに平行 (正射影) 投影を使用します。平行投影は、2D データセットの表示、CAD "
"風の正射影ビュー、透視歪みが望ましくない科学可視化に有用です。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.Camera.parallel_projection:8
msgid "Enable (True) or disable (False) parallel projection."
msgstr "平行投影を有効 (True) または無効 (False) にします。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of
#: pyvista_js.Camera.parallel_projection:11
msgid "Whether parallel projection is enabled."
msgstr "平行投影が有効かどうか。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.position:3
#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.position:6
msgid "Camera position as (x, y, z)."
msgstr "カメラの位置 (x, y, z)。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.camera.Camera.roll:3
msgid "Roll angle in degrees."
msgstr "ロール角 (度)。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.view_angle:3
msgid "View angle in degrees (field of view)."
msgstr "視野角 (field of view) の度数。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.view_angle:6
msgid "View angle in degrees."
msgstr "視野角の度数。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.view_up:3
#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.Camera.view_up:6
msgid "View-up vector as (x, y, z)."
msgstr "ビューアップベクトル (x, y, z)。"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.camera.Camera.zoom:3
msgid ""
"Zoom factor.  Values greater than 1 move the camera closer (zoom in); values"
" between 0 and 1 move it farther away (zoom out)."
msgstr "ズーム倍率。1 より大きい値でカメラを近づけ (ズームイン)、0 から 1 の間の値で遠ざけます (ズームアウト)。"

#: ../api/_autosummary/pyvista_js.Camera.rst:0
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "例外"

#: ../../src/pyvista_js/camera.pydocstring of pyvista_js.camera.Camera.zoom:8
msgid "If *factor* is not positive."
msgstr "*factor* が正でない場合。"
